  "title": "Port x86 Windows apps to ARM on Snapdragon with AI",
  "description": "Learn how to optimize and port Windows apps for ARM on Snapdragon with minimal code changes. This session covers the developer toolchain, including compilers, debuggers, profilers, and GitHub Actions, along with current ecosystem support. See where ARM performance gains are real today, and how agentic AI can help convert and validate x86 applications for speed, compatibility, and scale.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
